<title>USA: Durakon Industries Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Durakon Industries Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>LAPEER, Mich. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>	    ($ In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					  Quarters Ended  Years Ended</p>
<p>					   December 31,  December 31,</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>			(Unaudited) (Audited) (Unaudited) (Audited)</p>
<p> Net sales			44,050   42,744  183,628  172,051</p>
<p> Cost of products sold	35,226   36,827  143,950  135,692</p>
<p>   Gross profit		  8,824    5,917   39,678   36,359</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative expenses   6,094    8,607   26,545   28,288</p>
<p> Disposition of Subsidiary (A)  --    2,900	 --    2,900</p>
<p>Operating income (loss) (B)</p>
<p>				     2,730  (5,590)   13,133    5,171</p>
<p> Interest income, net	    110	 82	629	358</p>
<p> Other income (expense)	  (1)    (111)     (65)    (484)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) before</p>
<p>   income taxes		  2,839  (5,619)   13,697    5,045</p>
<p>Provision/benefit for</p>
<p>   income taxes		    762  (1,053)    4,793    2,746</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     2,077  (4,566)    8,904    2,299</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>   per common share	     0.31  ( 0.69)     1.34     0.34</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   (in 000's)		    6,672    6,678    6,647    6,687</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) In December 1995, ZZ Wheelz business unit was shut down. Pre-tax charge was $2.9 million or $0.37/shr. (B) Includes $5.1 million pre-tax charge ($0.59/share after-tax) in Q4 and $6.3 million pre-tax charge ($0.69/share after-tax) in 1995 for nonrecurring charges related to closing of ZZ Wheelz, patent settlement, re-engineering of manufacturing processes and plant consolidation.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
